From 4e3b5b846b330e48e54b1c6c0188cd190e406ac8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:28:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 48/56] m3 layers: the fresnel term

- layers.glsl: fresnelTerm (psmateriallayer.fx CalcFresnelTerm, the
  WhiteoutFlakes abs arm): 1 - |N.V| to the exponent, inverted for mode
  2, then saturate(f x fresnelMaxOffset + fresnelMin). N is the shading
  normal, V the eye vector, both tangent space (v_eyeVec).
- standard.frag computes the normal first and switches the term on;
  particle and displacement layers take none.
- layer.ts binds mode, exponent, min, offset; layerOptions.fresnel for
  tests.

Known defects:
- The fresnel mask, translation and rotation are not applied.
---
